message: 'If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.'
title: Grognard
abstract: >-
  Grognard is a desktop XML markup editor forked from the in-browser tool
  LEAF-Writer. It wraps the web app in Electron for offline, individual desktop
  use and adds workflow changes aimed at local editing and East Asian documents,
  including local authority packs and plugins for auto-tagging and
  disambiguation.
type: software
